Base URL: http://localhost:3000
POST
Create student

/api/students

Body → raw → JSON:
{
  "name": "Manjula",
  "email": "manjula@example.com",
  "department": "IT",
  "year": 4
}


Expected: 201 Created



GET
Get all students

/api/students

Expected: 200 OK and saved student records.



GET
Get one student

/api/students/STUDENT_ID

Replace STUDENT_ID with the _id returned by the POST request.



PATCH
Update student

/api/students/STUDENT_ID
{
  "department": "Computer Science"
}


Expected: 200 OK



DELETE
Delete student

/api/students/STUDENT_ID

Expected: 200 OK
